            <div id="content">Default window text (this system is stupid)</div>
        </div>
        <div id="Contacts">
            Dylan Curry Email: AmyCurry42@gmail.com  <br>
            LinkedIn: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dylan-curry-9a4916395/">Dylan Curry</a>
        </div>
        <div id="Personal">
            A qualified games designer with experience designing, programming
